Hmm maxCacheSize doesn't exist in this version → skip. Actually let me not set it.

Also `t.setResolutionFromRenderer(camera, renderer)` — depends on renderer size and pixelRatio. Good.

3. Lamps → InstancedMesh. Let me rewrite the lamp block:

```js
const lampGeo=new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.22,0.28,9,6);
const headGeo=new THREE.SphereGeometry(0.4,10,8);
